{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人羅天宇、李思雅（Cindy）及林漪娸等，今日（27日）出席慈善哥爾夫球賽。</p><p>羅天宇笑言近日對哥爾夫球達沉迷程度，更揚言希望追進度參加比賽：「要能力再好啲先，依家好勤力尋日練完今朝又練。</p><p>」身旁李思雅即爆他「勤力到癲」：「試過有次日頭打完比賽</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:44:14.159682+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:35:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:20.156253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:20.156253+00:00","content_hash":"ffe63a2082cee1698c55d933d17ac16b515464d9ebe58a998105848fd79732b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}